<title>USA: PFF Bancorp sets five pct share buyback.</title>
<headline>PFF Bancorp sets five pct share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PFF Bancorp Inc said it would proceed with the repurchase of up to five percent of its outstanding common stock, or 942,281 shares, following the conclusion of the required notification period.</p>
<p>PFF Bancorp said it would purchase shares in open market transactions from time to time, depending on market conditions. In January 1997, the company said it bought back an initial five percent or 991,875 shares of its then outstanding common stock at a price of $14.94 per share.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
